<string name="about_app_philosophy_title">ApriReader Philosophy</string>
<string name="about_app_philosophy_desc">ApriReader is designed for clean, fast, and uncompromisingly private reading. No ads, no trackers, no hidden cloud sync. All your books, notes, and stats belong solely to you and reside entirely on your device.</string>
<string name="about_features_title">Key Features</string>
<string name="about_feature_formats">Support for EPUB, FB2, PDF, CBZ/CBR formats</string>
<string name="about_feature_reading_modes">Reading modes: Paged, Continuous Scroll, RSVP Speed Reading, Bionic Reading</string>
<string name="about_feature_tts">Local Text-to-Speech (TTS) with third-party engine support</string>
<string name="about_feature_privacy">100% offline autonomy and privacy without telemetry</string>
<string name="about_feature_customization">Deep customization: fonts, themes, 3D shelves, and scaling</string>
<string name="about_cache_cleared">Cache successfully cleared</string>
<string name="tos_title">Terms of Service</string>
<string name="tos_last_updated">Last updated: August 2026</string>
<string name="tos_sec1_title">License &amp; Usage</string>
<string name="tos_sec1_body">ApriReader is provided free of charge under open-source terms. You are entitled to use the application for personal and non-commercial purposes on any compatible Android devices.</string>
<string name="tos_sec2_title">Local Storage &amp; Autonomy</string>
<string name="tos_sec2_body">The app operates completely autonomously. All added books, covers, notes, bookmarks, highlights, and reading progress are stored exclusively on your local device storage and are never transmitted to developers or third parties.</string>
<string name="tos_sec3_title">User Content &amp; Copyright</string>
<string name="tos_sec3_body">Users bear full responsibility for the legality of book files imported into the app and compliance with relevant copyright laws in their jurisdiction.</string>
<string name="tos_sec4_title">Network Metadata (Opt-in)</string>
<string name="tos_sec4_body">Online metadata enrichment via open databases (OpenLibrary, Google Books, FantLab) is disabled by default and requires explicit opt-in. Queries send only the book title and author, without any personal identifiers.</string>
<string name="tos_sec5_title">Speech Synthesis (TTS)</string>
<string name="tos_sec5_body">Book narration is handled by built-in system or user-selected local Android TTS engines. The app does not utilize remote cloud speech services.</string>
<string name="tos_sec6_title">Disclaimer of Warranties</string>
<string name="tos_sec6_body">The software is provided \'AS IS\', without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The developers shall not be liable for any data loss or device malfunctions.</string>
<string name="privacy_manifesto_title">100% Privacy Manifesto</string>
<string name="privacy_manifesto_subtitle">Your library belongs to you alone. We collect and transmit zero personal data.</string>
<string name="privacy_sec1_title">Zero Analytics &amp; Trackers</string>
<string name="privacy_sec1_body">ApriReader contains no Google Analytics, Firebase Analytics, Crashlytics, or advertising SDKs. We do not track which books you read, your reading time, or your location.</string>
<string name="privacy_sec2_title">Local On-Device Storage</string>
<string name="privacy_sec2_body">All databases (Room SQLite), preferences (Preferences DataStore), and cover caches reside securely within the app\'s sandboxed storage on your device.</string>
<string name="privacy_sec3_title">Storage Access Framework</string>
<string name="privacy_sec3_body">Book access utilizes Android\'s standard Storage Access Framework (SAF). The app only reads folders and files you explicitly grant access to.</string>
<string name="privacy_sec4_title">Full Control &amp; Data Deletion</string>
<string name="privacy_sec4_body">You can clear cache, remove sources, or uninstall the app at any time. Uninstalling completely wipes all internal databases and metadata from your device.</string>
<string name="licenses_title">Open Source Software</string>
<string name="licenses_subtitle">ApriReader is built upon trusted open-source technologies and libraries:</string>
